# SmartSafe repository ignore rules
# Project stack: Atmel Studio / AVR-GCC + Proteus + LaTeX documentation.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor temporary files
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.temp

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Atmel Studio / Visual Studio user-specific state and caches
# Keep: *.atsln, *.cproj, and *.componentinfo.xml (project metadata).
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.atsuo
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Atmel Studio / AVR-GCC build output
# Debug/ currently contains generated Makefiles, dependency files, objects,
# firmware images, maps, listings, and ELF files for both master and slave.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/

*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.hex
*.eep
*.eeprom
*.srec
*.lss
*.map
*.lst
*.a
*.usersignatures

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Proteus local state / automatic backups
# Keep the real simulation project: SmartSafe.pdsprj
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Project Backups/
*.pdsprj.*.workspace
*.pdsbak
*.pdsprj.bak

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX generated/intermediate files
# PDFs are intentionally NOT ignored because this archive contains report PDFs
# that appear to be project deliverables, including PDFs without matching .tex.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.dvi
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.glg
*.glo
*.gls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.ist
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.out
*.run.xml
*.snm
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.vrb
*.xdv
_minted-*/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generic backup files
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
